    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reclaim your home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide and fight with your army and fight back the enemy invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/b3e00d5485c8a1ef0bd5fe7e54376ba2.poster.avif?t=1755267994\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/b3e00d5485c8a1ef0bd5fe7e54376ba2.webm?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/b3e00d5485c8a1ef0bd5fe7e54376ba2.mp4?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade and become stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your currency to upgrade your troops and skills. Hit harder, be faster, let fire arrows rain upon your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/536a302315682b50cb9224420dce1807.poster.avif?t=1755267994\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/536a302315682b50cb9224420dce1807.webm?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/536a302315682b50cb9224420dce1807.mp4?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of open levels and biomes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/71cca993b1f2caa746611473ea820d57.poster.avif?t=1755267994\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/71cca993b1f2caa746611473ea820d57.webm?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/71cca993b1f2caa746611473ea820d57.mp4?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take down powerful foes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down the heads of the invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/3cc2b9b64ce3b962fd7455bdc30ec372.poster.avif?t=1755267994\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/3cc2b9b64ce3b962fd7455bdc30ec372.webm?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/3cc2b9b64ce3b962fd7455bdc30ec372.mp4?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new Units</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your army fitting to your play style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/b523457663833700d2c8cfdec99373dc.poster.avif?t=1755267994\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/b523457663833700d2c8cfdec99373dc.webm?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/b523457663833700d2c8cfdec99373dc.mp4?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wield and unlock powerful spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the situation ever gets tricky you can call upon the gods to grad you a favour.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/541db942b73aa0ceec2a251210aa8a64.poster.avif?t=1755267994\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/541db942b73aa0ceec2a251210aa8a64.webm?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/541db942b73aa0ceec2a251210aa8a64.mp4?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reclaim your home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide and fight with your army and fight back the enemy invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/b3e00d5485c8a1ef0bd5fe7e54376ba2.poster.avif?t=1755267994\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/b3e00d5485c8a1ef0bd5fe7e54376ba2.webm?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/b3e00d5485c8a1ef0bd5fe7e54376ba2.mp4?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade and become stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your currency to upgrade your troops and skills. Hit harder, be faster, let fire arrows rain upon your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/536a302315682b50cb9224420dce1807.poster.avif?t=1755267994\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/536a302315682b50cb9224420dce1807.webm?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/536a302315682b50cb9224420dce1807.mp4?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of open levels and biomes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/71cca993b1f2caa746611473ea820d57.poster.avif?t=1755267994\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/71cca993b1f2caa746611473ea820d57.webm?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/71cca993b1f2caa746611473ea820d57.mp4?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take down powerful foes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down the heads of the invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/3cc2b9b64ce3b962fd7455bdc30ec372.poster.avif?t=1755267994\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/3cc2b9b64ce3b962fd7455bdc30ec372.webm?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/3cc2b9b64ce3b962fd7455bdc30ec372.mp4?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new Units</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your army fitting to your play style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/b523457663833700d2c8cfdec99373dc.poster.avif?t=1755267994\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/b523457663833700d2c8cfdec99373dc.webm?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/b523457663833700d2c8cfdec99373dc.mp4?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wield and unlock powerful spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the situation ever gets tricky you can call upon the gods to grad you a favour.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/541db942b73aa0ceec2a251210aa8a64.poster.avif?t=1755267994\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/541db942b73aa0ceec2a251210aa8a64.webm?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737730/extras/541db942b73aa0ceec2a251210aa8a64.mp4?t=1755267994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
